Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Right?Comment: 0,0:19:01.07,0:19:04.91,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,That's right!Comment: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:13.29,Lunch Time - Copy,,0,0,0,karaoke,If I think of tomorrow,Comment: 0,0:19:04.91,0:19:13.29,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,I can tolerate anything!Comment: 0,0:19:14.17,0:19:18.17,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,How can I be angry?!Comment: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:22.47,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Tomorrow is going to be a great day!Comment: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:27.39,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,A happy day!Comment: 0,0:19:37.49,0:19:42.07,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Wedding cake! Queen of the cakes!Comment: 0,0:19:42.07,0:19:46.24,Lunch Time,,0,0,0,karaoke,Wedding cake!Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:34.36,Title,,0,0,0,,Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.36,0:01:39.03,Title,,0,0,0,,Luffy and Big MomDialogue: 0,0:01:35.07,0:01:39.07,Captions,,0,0,0,,"Mirro-World" – Brûlée's HouseDialogue: 0,0:01:47.42,0:01:51.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Chobro, help! It's hot!Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:55.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop whining, you brat!Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:57.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't eat humans.Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.59,0:02:01.60,Main,,0,0,0,,But the Minks could be edible, so I gotta try.Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.60,0:02:04.72,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't eat me! I'm not delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.72,0:02:07.28,Main,,0,0,0,,Let Carrot go, Brûlée!Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:11.40,Main,,0,0,0,,She's not a real rabbit! Of course, she's not delicious!Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:13.50,Main,,0,0,0,,– What? Is that true?Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.40,0:02:12.68,Secondary,,0,0,0,,– He's right!Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.50,0:02:16.44,Main,,0,0,0,,– Then, maybe I shouldn't try.Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.68,0:02:16.44,Secondary,,0,0,0,,– I'm too tough and stinky and disgusting!Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.63,0:02:23.74,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not gonna let her go. Keep your mouth shut, you odd reindeer.Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.74,0:02:27.30,Main,,0,0,0,,You'll join Mama's collection of strange beasts!Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.30,0:02:30.00,Main,,0,0,0,,C-Collection of strange beasts?Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.00,0:02:34.58,Main,,0,0,0,,That's right. So just sit there quietly.Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.47,0:02:46.33,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Okay! We managed to get to this point.Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.31,0:02:49.74,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,I made sure to get tied up in Heavy Point,Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.74,0:02:53.53,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,so I could escape from these chains instantly by transforming.Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.53,0:02:57.94,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm giving Chopper trouble! Pedro will be mad at me!Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.94,0:03:03.94,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,It's been at least six hours since I used Monster Point yesterday, so that's at my disposal, too!Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.59,0:03:24.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Chobro!Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.39,0:03:26.14,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Now's the chance!Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:31.44,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake IslandDialogue: 0,0:03:31.48,0:03:34.02,Captions,,0,0,0,,Capital, Sweet CityDialogue: 0,0:03:36.44,0:03:41.45,Captions,,0,0,0,,Whole Cake Chateau LibraryDialogue: 0,0:03:42.04,0:03:44.08,Main,,0,0,0,,Here it is.Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.71,0:03:50.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Within books, you can find an infinite array of worlds.Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.80,0:03:56.25,Main,,0,0,0,,Look. This is a super-rare, man-eating lion with a human face.Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.04,0:03:58.76,Main,,0,0,0,,"Manticore."Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.76,0:04:01.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a strange beast that escaped from Impel Down...Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.58,0:04:04.96,Main,,0,0,0,,during Blackbeard's assault 2 years ago.Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.96,0:04:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Loincloth, loincloth!Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.80,0:04:07.66,Main,,0,0,0,,It moved!Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.66,0:04:10.68,Main,,0,0,0,,And this one is my pride and joy!Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.61,0:04:15.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Isn't it beautiful?Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.60,0:04:19.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Well... close enough. But it's living in the book.Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.44,0:04:24.16,Main,,0,0,0,,The animals within the books will never age.Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.16,0:04:30.62,Main,,0,0,0,,It makes sense, right? The contents of a book never change.Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.62,0:04:32.32,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.16,0:04:40.80,Main,,0,0,0,,The books in this library contain rare creatures from all over the world.Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.80,0:04:41.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Cool!Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.88,0:04:45.63,Main,,0,0,0,,That's what my son, Mont d'Or, is capable of.Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.63,0:04:49.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Recently, we got a Centaur from Punk Hazard,Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.47,0:04:52.68,Main,,0,0,0,,and a Gryphon from the South Blue.Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:55.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I even got one of these!Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.77,0:04:57.82,Main,,0,0,0,,A Longlimb human!Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.82,0:04:59.36,Main,,0,0,0,,Help!Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.36,0:05:01.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me out!Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.15,0:05:03.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Even a human?Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:07.20,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.95,0:05:13.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Since I stepped into this country, I've seen a wide variety of races.Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.89,0:05:19.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Of course! Because that's the kind of country that Totto Land is supposed to be!Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.44,0:05:24.80,Main,,0,0,0,,But there is one race that I haven't seen, and I haven't been able to stop thinking about it.Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.80,0:05:27.98,Main,,0,0,0,,If they were here, we would know.Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:31.14,Main,,0,0,0,,The Giants!Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.31,0:05:38.23,Main,,0,0,0,,For a nation of all races, it's odd that I haven't seen a single giant.Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.23,0:05:41.07,Main,,0,0,0,,I've only seen large humans.Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.50,0:05:51.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.14,0:05:55.18,Main,,0,0,0,,I guess you just haven't seen one yet.Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.18,0:05:57.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.67,0:06:01.07,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you want?Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.07,0:06:07.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Ma... Mama... Ma, we... we... we have brought those... those two here!Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.84,0:06:10.82,Main,,0,0,0,,Okay.Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.22,0:06:14.34,Main,,0,0,0,,Will you excuse me? It's a very busy day.Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.34,0:06:18.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I hope you have a good afternoon, despite the bad weather!Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.55,0:06:22.01,Main,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with you?Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.01,0:06:24.73,Main,,0,0,0,,W-Well, I got nervous.Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.73,0:06:27.89,Main,,0,0,0,,They're the real Germa 66.Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.89,0:06:32.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Ichiji-sama and Reiju-sama were just as cool as I thought they'd be.Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:39.58,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! You're foolish to  have been influenced by a comic strip!Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:43.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Their "looks" aren't what's important.Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.09,0:06:45.38,Captions,,0,0,0,,Prison Library, Whole Cake ChateauDialogue: 0,0:06:46.30,0:06:49.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Let's see, what page was it?Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.00,0:06:51.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Page 55-fa.Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.42,0:06:53.93,Main,,0,0,0,,55.Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.93,0:06:55.59,Main,,0,0,0,,There they are.Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.59,0:06:59.02,Main,,0,0,0,,These two? I like the look on their faces.Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.02,0:07:01.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.06,0:07:05.42,Main,,0,0,0,,How long are you gonna keep us like this?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.42,0:07:06.90,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me take a shower!Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.90,0:07:09.61,Main,,0,0,0,,My body is covered in sticky syrup!Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:14.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You look so sweet, Candy-chan. Lick!Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.11,0:07:15.12,Captions,,0,0,0,,Perospero – Eldest Son of the Charlotte FamilyDialogue: 0,0:07:16.70,0:07:18.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Here comes Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.74,0:07:19.87,Main,,0,0,0,,What?Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.92,0:07:25.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh?Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.71,0:07:27.42,Main,,0,0,0,,A Transponder Snail?!Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:38.70,Main,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, Straw Hat Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:41.56,Main,,0,0,0,,You finally made it this far.Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:43.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Is this Big Mom?Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.44,0:07:47.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me out! I gotta go back!Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.56,0:07:50.86,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get out of here, even if I have to destroy everything!Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.35,0:07:57.80,Main,,0,0,0,,Whoa-whoa, you've still got that kind of spirit.Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.29,0:08:01.46,Main,,0,0,0,,Since you didn't bring your entire crew,Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.46,0:08:06.92,Main,,0,0,0,,I thought you'd forgotten what you said to me on Fishman Island.Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.30,0:08:10.42,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll kick your ass all over the New World,Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.42,0:08:14.09,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,and make Fishman Island my territory!Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.25,0:08:18.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll kick your ass someday!Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.60,0:08:22.90,Main,,0,0,0,,But we just came to take Sanji back this time!Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.90,0:08:26.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough with bluffing!Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:40.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! If you wanna fight, show yourself, Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.40,0:08:47.54,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fight you right here!Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:58.60,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey! Come on, Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.81,0:09:02.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Show yourself!Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.98,0:09:07.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll fight you!Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.07,0:09:11.44,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't push your luck.Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.44,0:09:16.53,Main,,0,0,0,,You're a Rookie who just entered the New World.Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:20.45,Main,,0,0,0,,That's presumptuous of you to request an audience with me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:28.67,Main,,0,0,0,,They don't need my help in killing you.Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.84,0:09:36.47,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully, Straw Hat.Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:44.39,Main,,0,0,0,,If you give up on Sanji completely, I'll let you leave alive.Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.39,0:09:45.85,Main,,0,0,0,,Screw that!Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.52,0:09:51.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Sanji and Pudding's wedding...Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:53.64,Main,,0,0,0,,... is very special to me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.64,0:09:56.19,Main,,0,0,0,,... is very special to me.Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.70,0:10:04.95,Main,,0,0,0,,So sit there quietly until everything is over.Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:15.59,Main,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat, if you spoil what I've been looking forward to,Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.50,0:10:22.05,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll really make you pay for it!Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.85,0:10:27.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.02,0:10:30.19,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you remember?Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:35.32,Main,,0,0,0,,When you ate all of the candies that were made for me,Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.32,0:10:41.99,Main,,0,0,0,,you gave me all the treasure that you got from King Neptune.Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.99,0:10:45.41,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,We have a lot of treasure with us here.Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.05,0:10:50.05,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You can have it all! In compensation for the sweets!Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.04,0:10:58.88,Main,,0,0,0,,Guess what we found in there!Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.86,0:11:05.35,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't say that you want it back!Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.68,0:11:09.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It's a legendary treasure box that was passed down forDialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:12.27,Main,,0,0,0,,generations on Fishman Island.Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.27,0:11:14.77,Main,,0,0,0,,It's the Tamate Box.Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.78,0:11:23.08,Main,,0,0,0,,I wonder why Neptune let go of it.Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.08,0:11:28.58,Main,,0,0,0,,It's certainly a national treasure. I wonder what's in it.Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:36.76,Main,,0,0,0,,I love treasure boxes!Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.76,0:11:41.30,Main,,0,0,0,,So forget about the candies.Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:46.85,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to open the Tamate Box in front of everyone at the tea party tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:51.14,Main,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be fun!Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:55.27,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not gonna be fun! Sanji won't get married!Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.61,0:11:59.07,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn!Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.07,0:12:01.40,Main,,0,0,0,,– Oh, yeah! I wanna see Pudding! – Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.40,0:12:04.70,Main,,0,0,0,,– I need to talk to her! She's my friend! – Don't mention her!Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.70,0:12:07.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Huh? Friend?Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:15.04,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be absurd. Why would the bride be your friend?Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.80,0:12:19.33,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.88,0:12:21.97,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop joking around!Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.97,0:12:23.88,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, girl,Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.44,0:12:28.72,Main,,0,0,0,,I heard you killed Lola.Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.72,0:12:32.09,Main,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?! She's my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.09,0:12:35.52,Main,,0,0,0,,She gave me the Vivre Card as a token of friendship!Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.15,0:12:39.34,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'll put my signature on Mama's Vivre Card,Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.34,0:12:43.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,so if you run into trouble, you can use this to find her.Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:46.90,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,When you see her, tell her I'm doing fine.Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.90,0:12:49.24,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Lola.Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:52.00,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola was doing fine.Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.00,0:12:55.33,Main,,0,0,0,,That's the message she sent. There, I delivered it.Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.83,0:12:58.75,Main,,0,0,0,,She told me that her mother was a pirate,Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.75,0:13:02.01,Main,,0,0,0,,but I didn't expect that it'd be the Emperor Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.59,0:13:07.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola thought that if I showed you the Vivre Card, you'd help me...Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.01,0:13:10.22,Main,,0,0,0,,You've gotta be joking!Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:25.89,Main,,0,0,0,,I don't care if she's "fine".Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.89,0:13:27.22,Main,,0,0,0,,I want her dead!Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.22,0:13:28.16,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.62,0:13:31.03,Main,,0,0,0,,If you know where she is, tell me.Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.03,0:13:34.79,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll send an assassin right away to kill her!Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.79,0:13:39.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised by the fact she still thinks that we're family!Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.00,0:13:43.10,Main,,0,0,0,,Children don't know how indebted they are to their parents, and this proves it!Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:49.26,Main,,0,0,0,,She's a dumb daughter who ran away rejecting the biggest-ever political marriage!Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.26,0:13:52.47,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive her!Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.28,0:14:00.11,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,One of you can have me as a wife! Especially you! Do you wanna marry me?Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.56,0:14:04.86,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Absalom is gonna marry me!Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:08.84,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I think you two would make a great couple, and I want to help!Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.84,0:14:11.72,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,What?! Really?!Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.09,0:14:15.45,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I'm here to save you, my friend!Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:19.50,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Lola!Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.50,0:14:23.25,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Lola! I'm so happy to see you again!Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.25,0:14:29.27,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,It's just for you, because you and I are like sisters.Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola...Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:36.22,Main,,0,0,0,,If only...Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.93,0:14:41.10,Main,,0,0,0,,... she'd done what I said and gotten married...Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.10,0:14:44.02,Main,,0,0,0,,I could've gained tremendous power!Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.02,0:14:50.41,Main,,0,0,0,,I'd already have beaten Kaidou, Red-Hair and even Whitebeard,Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.41,0:14:52.32,Main,,0,0,0,,and I'd already be...Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:57.29,Main,,0,0,0,,... the King of the Pirates!Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.06,0:15:12.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola's friend, Cat Burglar Nami.Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.55,0:15:17.93,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make you cough up where she is.Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.42,0:15:23.81,Main,,0,0,0,,What a stupid story, Big Mom.Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.20,0:15:30.78,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola's the one who didn't get married.Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.49,0:15:37.77,Main,,0,0,0,,And you're the one who hasn't become the King of the Pirates.Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.04,0:15:41.37,Main,,0,0,0,,That's all.Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.83,0:15:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy...Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.71,0:15:48.09,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm here to pick another fight with you!Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.09,0:15:52.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't be cocky just because you're an emperor!Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:54.60,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm going to take Sanji back!Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:58.85,Main,,0,0,0,,And at the end, we're the ones who'll win!Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.03,0:16:20.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What's going on-soir?Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.03,0:16:24.70,Main,,0,0,0,,Ring, ring, ring... Ring, ring, ring... Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.70,0:16:27.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Baron Tamago, it's the intruder!Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.52,0:16:30.01,Main,,0,0,0,,The Tiger Mink is here!Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.01,0:16:32.26,Main,,0,0,0,,No, he's a Jaguar Mink!Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.26,0:16:37.26,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Pedro... He's already in the castle, as I thought.Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:38.56,Main,,0,0,0,,Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:40.68,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Big Mom!Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.39,0:16:43.98,Main,,0,0,0,,You're so funny!Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.56,0:16:47.57,Main,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding!Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.57,0:16:51.83,Main,,0,0,0,,How could you pick a fight with Mama in this castle?!Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.83,0:16:54.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Shut up! Bring it on, you fools!Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.57,0:16:58.83,Main,,0,0,0,,Lola...Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.62,0:17:08.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, big brothers and sisters! Coming through! Coming through!Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.18,0:17:11.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Anglaise, what's up?Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.80,0:17:21.23,Main,,0,0,0,,We have an intrudee in the Treasure Room! Coming through!Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.23,0:17:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Do you mean an intruder, Anglaise?Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.77,0:17:24.98,Main,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it!Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.98,0:17:29.56,Main,,0,0,0,,And I'm not gonna brush my teeth today! Coming through!Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.94,0:17:35.95,Captions,,0,0,0,,A Guest Room Where Sanji is StayingDialogue: 0,0:17:37.41,0:17:39.03,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Please...Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.42,0:17:42.08,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Everyone, get out of here safely.Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.90,0:17:45.71,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get away!Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:17:59.26,Main,,0,0,0,,Hustle up!Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.26,0:18:01.94,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let him do whatever he wants!Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:04.89,Main,,0,0,0,,The intruder's in the other area!Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:11.61,Main,,0,0,0,,Now, in the pirate Emperor Big Mom's castle...Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.28,0:18:16.73,Main,,0,0,0,,It's time to start...Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.73,0:18:19.41,Main,,0,0,0,,... a special live performance!Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:22.91,Captions,,0,0,0,,Queen's ChamberDialogue: 0,0:18:24.24,0:18:27.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Aren't you angry, Mama?Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.33,0:18:32.75,Main,,0,0,0,,Just because that squirt picked a fight with me?Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.50,0:18:37.84,Main,,0,0,0,,No way, Zeus! Think about it!Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.43,0:19:32.31,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh? I received a signal. Mama!Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.31,0:19:35.66,Main,,0,0,0,,They say that an intruder is causing trouble near the Treasure Repository!Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.66,0:19:37.49,Main,,0,0,0,,An intruder?Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.21,0:19:54.13,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me they're going after my Tamate Box!Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:57.30,Main,,0,0,0,,Who is it?!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.21,0:20:01.63,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Oh, dammit, dammit!Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.67,0:20:03.18,Captions,,0,0,0,,Sanji's Guest RoomDialogue: 0,0:20:01.63,0:20:05.54,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Luffy and the others will be spared. Big Mom promised me.Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.54,0:20:08.77,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,As long as I get married, the Baratie will be okay, too.Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.35,0:20:14.38,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,Of course, it's hard to say goodbye to my friends, but at least nobody will die!Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.38,0:20:16.30,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,That's all that really matters!Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.25,0:20:19.15,Thoughts,,0,0,0,,So, why am I so upset?Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.92,0:20:22.15,Main,,0,0,0,,If I keep looking so tense...Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.15,0:20:25.37,Main,,0,0,0,,My only source of hope, Pudding-chan, will be sad!Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.91,0:20:32.00,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I won't let your marriage with me be hell!Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.25,0:20:40.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll be the lowest form of scum if I make her worry.Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.26,0:20:47.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Don't let a lovely girl like her be sad! Be my usual self!Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:50.43,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes! I'm a romantic cook!Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:52.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chan!Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.50,0:20:55.79,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-chwan!!Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.79,0:20:59.90,Main,,0,0,0,,I'll make you happy!Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.57,0:21:02.11,Captions,,0,0,0,,Pudding's RoomDialogue: 0,0:21:02.62,0:21:04.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Big Sis Lola's?Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.22,0:21:08.16,Main,,0,0,0,,Yes. The girl had her Vivre Card,Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:12.75,Main,,0,0,0,,and the Homies in the Seducing Woods were intimidated by it.Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.36,0:21:19.21,Main,,0,0,0,,By the way, Pudding-sama, the dress you chose yesterday was rejected by Mama.Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.21,0:21:23.01,Main,,0,0,0,,Please wear the dress Mama chose tomorrow.Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.43,0:21:27.03,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama has planned out everything after the wedding, too.Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.03,0:21:28.05,Main,,0,0,0,,Also...Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.85,0:21:34.89,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama, it's still raining in the yard.Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.34,0:21:36.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding-sama?Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.99,0:21:46.03,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Pudding, as long as you do what I say, you'll be alright.Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.78,0:21:52.04,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,You look just like a doll, Pudding.Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.14,0:21:55.15,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,Good girl, Pudding.Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.44,0:22:14.43,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,She's not gonna kill me. After all, we're family.Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.43,0:22:18.10,Flashbacks,,0,0,0,,I wanna choose my own husband!Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.24,0:22:38.00,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't believe they let this happen the day before the tea party!Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:48.13,Main,,0,0,0,,There he is!Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.62,0:22:57.14,Main,,0,0,0,,So quick!Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.95,0:23:12.03,Main,,0,0,0,,This is it, intruder!Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.17,0:23:26.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot!Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.47,0:23:36.22,Main,,0,0,0,,Shoot him down!Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.31,0:23:45.57,Main,,0,0,0,,Run!Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.13,0:24:03.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Where is he now?!Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.29,0:24:05.84,Main,,0,0,0,,He went downstairs to the third floor of the Red-Bean Baum Cake,Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.84,0:24:07.67,Main,,0,0,0,,near the Courtyard!Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.67,0:24:12.80,Main,,0,0,0,,It won't be easy to take him down! Corner him in the garden-soir!Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.80,0:24:15.26,Main,,0,0,0,,– Roger! – Clank.Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:23.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I can't handle any more soldiers!Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.60,0:24:27.48,Main,,0,0,0,,There you are, intruder.Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.21,0:24:34.45,Main,,0,0,0,,Well, there are a lot less than before.Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.45,0:24:37.24,Main,,0,0,0,,Only Pedro-san could've done that!Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.58,0:24:41.02,Main,,0,0,0,,What kind of creature are you?Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.02,0:24:45.37,Main,,0,0,0,,You're very strange, even for this country.Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.13,0:24:47.96,Main,,0,0,0,,I agree.Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.85,0:24:50.84,Main,,0,0,0,,Mama would be happy.Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.26,0:24:55.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Get him!Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.14,0:24:59.18,Main,,0,0,0,,– Clank. – Hey, Baron Tamago!Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.18,0:25:00.86,Main,,0,0,0,,Smoothie-sama!Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.86,0:25:03.94,Main,,0,0,0,,You were right. There's another one.Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.94,0:25:06.44,Main,,0,0,0,,That one is bait, like you said.Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.45,0:25:10.69,Main,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Pedro! You created a big mess!Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.86,0:25:16.75,Main,,0,0,0,,We let him get into the Treasure Repository, and then he locked the door.Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.75,0:25:18.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Sorry. It's my fault.Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.66,0:25:22.00,Main,,0,0,0,,But there is only one entrance to the Treasure Repository.Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.00,0:25:28.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Even if he can steal the treasure, it's impossible for him to run from you, Smoothie-sama.Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.67,0:25:32.55,Main,,0,0,0,,As long as you guard the door closely, there won't be a problem-dezvous.Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.55,0:25:35.66,Main,,0,0,0,,You're right. You can count on me.Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.66,0:25:41.81,Main,,0,0,0,,If he defeats the guards inside and comes out, I'll kill him. Is that okay?Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.81,0:25:47.87,Main,,0,0,0,,No, the man inside is probably a skeleton-bon. Mama would love to have that strange beast.Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.87,0:25:50.76,Main,,0,0,0,,Defeat him, but don't kill him!Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:52.65,Main,,0,0,0,,Got it.Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.14,0:26:07.29,Main,,0,0,0,,Pedro-san told me...Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.29,0:26:13.09,Main,,0,0,0,,... that through Big Mom's ability, you are all infused with human souls.Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.29,0:26:09.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,BishopDialogue: 0,0:26:07.29,0:26:09.29,Captions,,0,0,0,,PawnDialogue: 0,0:26:09.29,0:26:11.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,KnightDialogue: 0,0:26:09.29,0:26:11.17,Captions,,0,0,0,,RookDialogue: 0,0:26:11.17,0:26:13.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,KingDialogue: 0,0:26:11.17,0:26:13.09,Captions,,0,0,0,,QueenDialogue: 0,0:26:13.09,0:26:16.55,Main,,0,0,0,,That means you Chess Peacekeepers are...Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.34,0:26:22.64,Main,,0,0,0,,... driven by soul!Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.24,0:26:25.81,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.31,0:26:28.95,Main,,0,0,0,,How powerful!Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.95,0:26:30.77,Main,,0,0,0,,Wait a second!Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.77,0:26:33.19,Main,,0,0,0,,It's not tuned yet!Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.19,0:26:36.92,Main,,0,0,0,,Tear him apart!Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.33,0:26:46.54,Main,,0,0,0,,This is it, you damn skeleton!Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.46,0:26:50.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, please!Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.21,0:26:52.54,Main,,0,0,0,,W-W-W-W-Wait, wait!Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.51,0:26:59.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Please wait!!Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.80,0:27:23.49,Main,,0,0,0,,What happened?!Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.49,0:27:29.21,Main,,0,0,0,,You don't know my other name, do you, baby?Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.11,0:27:45.89,Main,,0,0,0,,It's Soul King!Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.16,0:27:55.23,Main,,0,0,0,,The Chess Peacekeepers!Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.23,0:27:58.40,Main,,0,0,0,,The soldiers infused with souls...Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.90,0:28:05.03,Main,,0,0,0,,... cannot stay on their feet...Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.03,0:28:08.49,Main,,0,0,0,,... in the presence of my soul scream!!Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.54,0:28:14.08,Captions,,0,0,0,,Prison LibraryDialogue: 0,0:28:21.76,0:28:24.39,Main,,0,0,0,,Enough with that-fa!Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.81,0:28:35.52,Main,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is unexpected.Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.93,0:28:38.69,Main,,0,0,0,,What do you need, Pudding?Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.08,0:28:41.15,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding?Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.49,0:28:50.37,Main,,0,0,0,,– Hey! Pudding! Get us outta here! We got caught! – No, Luffy!Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.37,0:28:52.33,Main,,0,0,0,,The other guys are listening too!Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.33,0:28:55.96,Main,,0,0,0,,What brought you to a place like this-fa?Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.06,0:29:04.09,Main,,0,0,0,,Brother Opera, can I talk to Luffy-kun and Nami-chan in there for a minute?Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.09,0:29:09.51,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun? Yeah, go ahead-fa.Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.35,0:29:14.73,Main,,0,0,0,,Let me put a bookmark here.Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.14,0:29:26.66,Main,,0,0,0,,Pudding...Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.89,0:29:29.74,Main,,0,0,0,,You two...Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.31,0:29:32.95,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.95,0:29:35.30,Main,,0,0,0,,We went to the coast!Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.30,0:29:38.67,Main,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Pudding will be in trouble!Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.19,0:29:43.84,Main,,0,0,0,,You got beaten up.Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.28,0:29:46.55,Main,,0,0,0,,Luffy-kun.Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.55,0:29:48.74,Main,,0,0,0,,Nami-chan.Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.08,0:29:54.43,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sure my brothers and sisters did horrible things to you.Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.81,0:29:57.77,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.38,0:30:00.19,Main,,0,0,0,,No, don't...Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.76,0:30:05.12,Main,,0,0,0,,I couldn't go to the coast where we promised to meet, either...Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.12,0:30:06.75,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry!Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.75,0:30:10.74,Main,,0,0,0,,That's okay. Raise your head, please.Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.81,0:30:16.21,Main,,0,0,0,,Why are they whispering?Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.54,0:30:20.33,Main,,0,0,0,,I actually...Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.42,0:30:26.23,Main,,0,0,0,,... was proposed to by Sanji-san.Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.23,0:30:28.03,Main,,0,0,0,,What?!Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.41,0:31:04.46,Main,,0,0,0,,It made me happy.Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.57,0:31:06.80,Main,,0,0,0,,But...Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.63,0:31:11.76,Main,,0,0,0,,... I know Sanji-san is just being nice to me.Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.63,0:31:16.35,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm causing everyone trouble.Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.35,0:31:17.52,Main,,0,0,0,,That's not true...Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.59,0:31:24.32,Main,,0,0,0,,So, don't worry.Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.07,0:31:28.61,Main,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to marry him.Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.13,0:31:37.50,Main,,0,0,0,,Listen.Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.85,0:32:05.40,Main,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait, Pudding!Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.63,0:32:18.27,Main,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.79,0:32:25.38,Credits,,0,0,0,,Editing:  Feeso, Galaxy 9000  Timing: Halee  Quality Assurance: Feeso, Galaxy 9000, Gru